            "detailed_description": "The spiritual successor to the massively popular freeware top-down shooter BaboViolent2, Madballs in Babo:Invasion is an arena based 3D shooter offering players a satisfying and immersive experience in both single-player and multiplayer, including 'Invasion Mode' where players are able to design their own combat maps almost instantaneously by placing a combination of map tiles to create a never-before-seen map before gameplay starts. Truly, no two games are ever the same.<br>\t\t\t\t\tFeaturing the recently re-released Madballs™ characters, Oculus Orbus™  and Horn Head™, from the popular 1980s toys best remembered for their outrageously bad looks and graphically colourful names, Madballs in...Babo: Invasion is a feature laden 'casually hardcore' action shooter.<br>\t\t\t\t\tKey Features:<br>\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Single Player</strong> — Hours of repeatable gameplay through 10 epic levels<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>2-4 Player Online Co-op</strong> —  challenge individual campaign levels with your friends or play the whole campaign in ‘Enduro’ mode<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>16 Player Multiplayer</strong> —  21 maps to match all game sizes<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>'Invasion' Mode</strong> —  the signature mode of the game, players take turns placing map tiles to create a unique multiplayer map prior to each match<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Voice Chat</strong> — Talk to the other players in-game<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Classes</strong> —  10 character classes (each with 2 special abilities) over two warring factions, with each faction having 5 unique weapons each with two distinct firing modes<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Madballs Characters</strong> —  Oculus Orbus™ and Horn Head™ from the infamous 80’s toy craze as in-game characters<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>5 Archetypes</strong> —  Assault, Heavy, Runner, Flyer, Support<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Deployables</strong> — active (rocket turrets) or passive (healing towers) can be placed in Invasion mode<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Unlocks and Secrets</strong> —  50 unlocks and 50 Secrets to find during campaign gameplay<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Action</strong> —  emphasis on fast-paced, visceral action that is easy to pick and play, yet offers a real strategic challenge for hardcore gamers<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "The spiritual successor to the massively popular freeware top-down shooter BaboViolent2, Madballs in Babo:Invasion is an arena based 3D shooter offering players a satisfying and immersive experience in both single-player and multiplayer, including 'Invasion Mode' where players are able to design their own combat maps almost instantaneously by placing a combination of map tiles to create a never-before-seen map before gameplay starts. Truly, no two games are ever the same.<br>\t\t\t\t\tFeaturing the recently re-released Madballs™ characters, Oculus Orbus™  and Horn Head™, from the popular 1980s toys best remembered for their outrageously bad looks and graphically colourful names, Madballs in...Babo: Invasion is a feature laden 'casually hardcore' action shooter.<br>\t\t\t\t\tKey Features:<br>\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Single Player</strong> — Hours of repeatable gameplay through 10 epic levels<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>2-4 Player Online Co-op</strong> —  challenge individual campaign levels with your friends or play the whole campaign in ‘Enduro’ mode<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>16 Player Multiplayer</strong> —  21 maps to match all game sizes<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>'Invasion' Mode</strong> —  the signature mode of the game, players take turns placing map tiles to create a unique multiplayer map prior to each match<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Voice Chat</strong> — Talk to the other players in-game<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Classes</strong> —  10 character classes (each with 2 special abilities) over two warring factions, with each faction having 5 unique weapons each with two distinct firing modes<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Madballs Characters</strong> —  Oculus Orbus™ and Horn Head™ from the infamous 80’s toy craze as in-game characters<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>5 Archetypes</strong> —  Assault, Heavy, Runner, Flyer, Support<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Deployables</strong> — active (rocket turrets) or passive (healing towers) can be placed in Invasion mode<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Unlocks and Secrets</strong> —  50 unlocks and 50 Secrets to find during campaign gameplay<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Action</strong> —  emphasis on fast-paced, visceral action that is easy to pick and play, yet offers a real strategic challenge for hardcore gamers<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Now with cross-platform multiplayer! PC vs. Mac at last.",
